{"unit_id":"bwndlct__dsh-session-export#card-zh","repo":"bwndlct/dsh-session-export","commit":"eb18389192e36934718877fd7c6eb397f5cf1cd4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-export（DSH 插件，工具与可选命令）：把当前 DSH 会话转换为可归档、可阅读的 Markdown 或结构化 JSON。它从会话事件日志适配出插件自有格式，再提供模型可调用的 session_export 工具，以及在 commands 服务存在时注册的斜杠命令。用户可选择 Markdown、JSON 或同时导出；文件写入会话工作目录下的 .dsh/exports，包含对话消息、工具调用与结果等记录。适合需要留存、审阅或迁移当前会话的人。无需 API key 或外部服务；需要 DSH 会话与工具服务，斜杠命令还需要 commands 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:52-115","src/index.ts:123-156","src/session-adapter.ts:103-215","src/exporter.ts:64-96"]}
{"unit_id":"bwndlct__dsh-session-export#card-en","repo":"bwndlct/dsh-session-export","commit":"eb18389192e36934718877fd7c6eb397f5cf1cd4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-export saves the current DSH session as Markdown, JSON, or both, using a tool and optional slash commands. It adapts messages and tool activity into a versioned document and writes it under .dsh/exports. It requires DSH session and tools services; commands require the commands service.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:52-115","src/index.ts:123-156","src/session-adapter.ts:103-215","src/exporter.ts:64-96"]}
